ot/issues/122908\r\n- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122910 (as requested in rc) cc @Goldenlion5648 \r\n- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121203\r\n\r\nThis makes many actions focus on the Script Editor/Shader Editor text. Including clicking on the Script / Shader Editor tab, using the shortcut (including when its already open), using the Editor Dock menu option, restoring after floating, and using `EditorInterface.set_main_screen_editor(\"Script\")`.\r\nAlso applies when they are floating.\r\nThese either match 4.7.2 behavior or shouldn't cause any issues.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds a callback when a dock is focused (unexposed). The Script Editor uses this to move the focus to its CodeEdit. Also applies to Shader Editor.\r\nWhen a tab is clicked it now calls `focus_dock`. I don't think this has an effect in most cases since the tab would already be focused.\r\n\r\nAlso moved `ScriptEditor::update_layout` since it was near the unrelated `ScriptEditorQuickOpen` methods.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/god